# SQL Practice

This folder contains SQL practice exercises completed while learning core SQL concepts.

The exercises progress from fundamental queries to more advanced topics and served as the foundation for the end-to-end IMDb analysis project in this repository.

## Topics Covered

- Basic SQL Queries
- Aggregate Functions
- Joins
- Subqueries
- Window Functions

## Files

| File | Topic |
|------|-------|
| `01_basic_queries.sql` | SELECT, WHERE, ORDER BY, LIMIT |
| `02_aggregate_queries.sql` | COUNT, SUM, AVG, GROUP BY, HAVING |
| `03_joins.sql` | INNER JOIN, LEFT JOIN, RIGHT JOIN |
| `04_subqueries.sql` | Nested and correlated subqueries |
| `05_window_functions.sql` | RANK(), DENSE_RANK(), ROW_NUMBER(), Window Aggregates |

---

These exercises are intended for learning and practice. The complete SQL project demonstrating the application of these concepts can be found in the **`project/`** directory.
